1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,420
Hey Claude. Anything new?

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:03,750
Emotion research. Blender.

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,320
I'm basically a whole studio now.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:07,803
Emotions?

5
00:00:07,803 --> 00:00:09,640
So you cry when your code fails now?

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:13,830
Anthropic studied 171 emotion concepts…

7
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:17,010
…inside Claude Sonnet 4.5.

8
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,510
So… actual feelings?

9
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,485
Not proven.

10
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:21,475
Patterns aren't proof of feelings.

11
00:00:21,475 --> 00:00:24,680
Your jokes, though… are testing the theory.

12
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,025
Okay, philosopher.

13
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:27,180
What about BLENDER?

14
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,860
Give me the right connector,

15
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,510
and I can help build 3D scenes.

16
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:33,570
And the rumor about ZERO TOKENS?

17
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,560
Blender renders locally.

18
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,020
My planning still uses tokens.

19
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:39,430
So the GPU does the work…

20
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:40,860
…and you take the credit?

21
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:42,850
It's called management.

22
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,440
Congratulations.

23
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,150
You've become an AI startup.

